{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Watch every step\u2014one mistake could send you back to the start!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is drowning in a great flood, and alone cat must rely on expert jumping skills to survive. But escape won\u2019t be easy\u2026 When a shark breaks free from its aquarium and marks the cat as prey, every missed jump plunges you into the water\u2014where the shark drags you back to the starting point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges your memory, distance calculation, and quick thinking. Even with checkpoints, progress won\u2019t come easily. You are the brave cat who must leap, endure, and prove that small efforts can overcome great obstacles! \ud83d\udc31\ud83c\udf0a\ud83e\udd88</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Play as a brave cat surviving the flood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Precise jump mechanics requiring distance calculation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd88 Sharks that drag you back to the start when you fail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Challenges combining memory and quick reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Checkpoints that won\u2019t make things easier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True Cat Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765260/a8c296fe791cc21b7b5bd3b6aa7d2365f0bae9f1.jpg"},{"name":"Right on Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765260/8f2b820b3c9b7e675a586902aeef85c62058e4fb.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Farewell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765260/5f5938cb51bbcdb5f45c4f